{"availability":"available","full":"tushar152006/smart_shopping_assistant","name":"smart_shopping_assistant","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-03T19:03:11Z","updated":"2026-10-10T10:32:03Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://smart-shopping-assistant-zeta.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://smart-shopping-assistant-zeta.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:25.252Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:25.252Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:05:25.252Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.617Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T05:05:25.252Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Explainable Forgotten-Item Prediction Engine for Online Grocery Shoppers","Online grocery shoppers frequently forget essential staples (milk, bananas, olive oil) when finalizing their carts. Traditional recommender systems optimize for impulse purchases or click-through rates rather than basket completeness.","Smart Shopping Assistant solves this by combining:"],"features":["Association Rule Mining & Multi-Item Co-occurrence: Learning staple relationships across Instacart shopping baskets.","Personalized Purchase Frequency & Recency: Factoring in individual shopper reorder cycles and past favorites.","Transparent Explainability: Every recommendation is accompanied by human-interpretable rationale explaining why the item was flagged.","Sub-15ms Latency: Pre-computed, serialized feature artifacts served by an asynchronous FastAPI backend.","Personalized & Guest Modes: Switch seamlessly between guest basket analysis (pure co-occurrence) and 20 real historical shopper personas."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tushar152006/smart_shopping_assistant/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"581cc5cf6292788f1e0319b2ee6adff3f12fe6561fe961a1cf4b07f2bed1be37","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T11:06:43.6